{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 5291332,
  "courseSlug": "chatgpt-bard-bing-complete-guide-to-chatgpt-openai-apis",
  "courseTitle": "ChatGPT & Generative AI - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39062540",
      "title": "What is Advanced Data Analysis & One Word About Restrictions",
      "sourceHash": "5eeace360c538162516660d12b15de950acad26adc4fe7d8efe20ce9c0e87bd6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.1,
          "end": 3.21,
          "en": "So what's the idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.21,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "behind ChatGPT's Code Interpreter feature?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 12.11,
          "en": "Well, one very important use case for using ChatGPT,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.21,
          "end": 15.12,
          "en": "which we'll also explore in this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.12,
          "end": 18.57,
          "en": "is to use ChatGPT to generate code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.57,
          "end": 22.77,
          "en": "Because ChatGPT is capable of generating code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 22.77,
          "end": 26.73,
          "en": "for a vast variety of programming languages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.73,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "But without Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 32.04,
          "en": "you then have to take that generated code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 35.91,
          "en": "and execute it on your own, which often also means",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.91,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "that you need to install or set up extra tools",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 43.38,
          "en": "that might be required to execute that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.38,
          "end": 47.19,
          "en": "With Code Interpreter, ChatGPT is not just able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 47.19,
          "end": 49.02,
          "en": "to generate the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.02,
          "end": 52.71,
          "en": "but it's also able to execute that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 52.71,
          "end": 56.85,
          "en": "It's able to execute those generated code snippets",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 61.2,
          "en": "in an isolated restricted execution environment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 61.2,
          "end": 63.63,
          "en": "And therefore, certain restrictions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.63,
          "end": 66.27,
          "en": "to which I will come back will apply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.27,
          "end": 70.02,
          "en": "And at this point of time, it's also just Python code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.02,
          "end": 71.493,
          "en": "that can be executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.36,
          "end": 76.8,
          "en": "Nonetheless, this is, of course, an extremely useful feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 76.8,
          "end": 81.53999999999999,
          "en": "that can be used for a broad variety of use cases.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.53999999999999,
          "end": 84.27,
          "en": "You could use this feature to perform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.27,
          "end": 88.44,
          "en": "mathematical calculations and you would no longer face",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 88.44,
          "end": 91.38,
          "en": "the danger of running into hallucinations,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.38,
          "end": 95.52000000000001,
          "en": "since with Code Interpreter, ChatGPT is now able",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 95.52000000000001,
          "end": 98.52000000000001,
          "en": "to simply write the code that will then perform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 100.35,
          "en": "the mathematical calculation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.35,
          "end": 102.84,
          "en": "instead of trying to predict the result,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 105.06,
          "en": "which can sometimes be wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.06,
          "end": 108.84,
          "en": "You could also use Code Interpreter to generate dummy data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.84,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "or extract information from files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "or transform file content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 117.09,
          "en": "You can use it for data science to load and clean data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.09,
          "end": 120.6,
          "en": "and, of course, to analyze data and build charts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.6,
          "end": 123.09,
          "en": "And you can also use it for image editing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.09,
          "end": 126.12,
          "en": "for example, to analyze and transform images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.12,
          "end": 129.69,
          "en": "or do other exciting things with images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 129.69,
          "end": 132.33,
          "en": "And there might be more use cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.33,
          "end": 135.42,
          "en": "where you want to use Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.42,
          "end": 138.24,
          "en": "because even though these here are probably",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.24,
          "end": 141.66,
          "en": "the most important and common use cases,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.66,
          "end": 144.48,
          "en": "as with ChatGPT in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.48,
          "end": 147.27,
          "en": "it's, of course, ultimately your imagination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 147.27,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "that's the limit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 150.99,
          "en": "Though speaking of limits,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.99,
          "end": 155.01,
          "en": "Code Interpreter definitely has some limits,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.01,
          "end": 160.01,
          "en": "because the code that gets generated and executed by ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.5,
          "end": 164.4,
          "en": "is executed in an isolated execution environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.4,
          "end": 167.07,
          "en": "provided by OpenAI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.07,
          "end": 170.49,
          "en": "So that code that's generated and executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 170.49,
          "end": 175.49,
          "en": "is executed on machines owned and operated by OpenAI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.22,
          "end": 181.22,
          "en": "And therefore, certain restrictions set by OpenAI do apply.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.33,
          "end": 185.16,
          "en": "For example, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.16,
          "end": 188.52,
          "en": "OpenAI only provides an execution environment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.52,
          "end": 190.65,
          "en": "for Python code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.65,
          "end": 194.76,
          "en": "So you can't execute other code with Code Interpreter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.76,
          "end": 196.2,
          "en": "at this point of time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 196.2,
          "end": 199.59,
          "en": "though that, of course, may change over time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 202.86,
          "en": "In addition, the code that is being executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 202.86,
          "end": 207.39,
          "en": "in that environment does not have internet access.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.39,
          "end": 209.97,
          "en": "So if you are trying to run some code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 209.97,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "that would need to reach out to the internet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 217.32,
          "en": "for example, to crawl and summarize a website,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 220.263,
          "en": "that code would fail and would not work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 221.13,
          "end": 225.45,
          "en": "In addition, this environment, of course, also has no access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.45,
          "end": 230.01,
          "en": "to your local hard drive, because as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 230.01,
          "end": 232.82999999999998,
          "en": "that code's running on some machine owned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 232.82999999999998,
          "end": 235.02,
          "en": "and operated by OpenAI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 235.02,
          "end": 237.21,
          "en": "It's not running on your system",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 237.21,
          "end": 240.63,
          "en": "and it therefore doesn't have access to your system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.63,
          "end": 243.78,
          "en": "which, of course, in general is a good thing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 243.78,
          "end": 247.41,
          "en": "But if you are trying to run some code that needs to work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.41,
          "end": 250.23,
          "en": "with data that's stored on your machine,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 250.23,
          "end": 252.81,
          "en": "that code also would fail,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.81,
          "end": 255.99,
          "en": "though ChatGPT actually does allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 255.99,
          "end": 259.8,
          "en": "to also upload and download files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 259.8,
          "end": 262.26,
          "en": "when using Code Interpreter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 262.26,
          "end": 265.14,
          "en": "Though, of course, you should definitely take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 265.14,
          "end": 268.8,
          "en": "at OpenAI's privacy policy to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 268.8,
          "end": 271.8,
          "en": "how they might be using or storing the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 271.8,
          "end": 273.48,
          "en": "you are sharing with them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.48,
          "end": 276.12,
          "en": "for example, through file uploads.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 276.12,
          "end": 279,
          "en": "Because you might not want to share",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279,
          "end": 283.83,
          "en": "super sensitive internal company data, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 283.83,
          "end": 286.59000000000003,
          "en": "At least, you should be aware of how OpenAI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 286.59000000000003,
          "end": 289.2,
          "en": "is going to use that data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 289.2,
          "end": 292.68,
          "en": "Now, in addition, in that execution environment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 292.68,
          "end": 294.72,
          "en": "there is only a selected list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 294.72,
          "end": 298.98,
          "en": "of extra code packages available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 298.98,
          "end": 302.19,
          "en": "And with that, I mean extra packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 302.19,
          "end": 305.88,
          "en": "that contain some extra code that could be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 305.88,
          "end": 307.98,
          "en": "to execute your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 307.98,
          "end": 310.38,
          "en": "For example, there are packages that help",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 310.38,
          "end": 315.38,
          "en": "with image manipulation or with QR code generation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.69,
          "end": 320.19,
          "en": "And whilst this environment that's provided by OpenAI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 320.19,
          "end": 324.18,
          "en": "comes with many pre-installed utility packages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 324.18,
          "end": 326.67,
          "en": "that might be needed to run the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 326.67,
          "end": 329.1,
          "en": "you need to run for a given task,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 329.1,
          "end": 333.42,
          "en": "there also might be certain tasks you might want to perform",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 333.42,
          "end": 335.43,
          "en": "with help of Code Interpreter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 335.43,
          "end": 339.27,
          "en": "that just won't work, because a certain package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 339.27,
          "end": 342.03,
          "en": "that might be needed might be missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 342.03,
          "end": 346.92,
          "en": "Though in our experience, Code Interpreter and ChatGPT",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 346.92,
          "end": 350.52,
          "en": "are doing quite well when it comes to identifying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 350.52,
          "end": 354.84000000000003,
          "en": "such situations and are then often able to generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 354.84000000000003,
          "end": 358.83,
          "en": "and execute some alternative code that does not require",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 358.83,
          "end": 361.41,
          "en": "a certain package that might be missing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 361.41,
          "end": 362.88,
          "en": "Last but not least,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 362.88,
          "end": 366.03,
          "en": "another important Code Interpreter restriction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 366.03,
          "end": 370.29,
          "en": "is that it's only available for ChatGPT Plus users",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 370.29,
          "end": 372.423,
          "en": "and not in the free version.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "lectureOrder": 128,
      "videoOrder": 128
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
